Police Station: Chennai Cyber Crime PS
FIR No.: 776/2026

I received a phone call from a person claiming to be a bank official on 14 October 2026.
He convinced me to share my OTP and account details for a fake KYC update. Within minutes,
Rs. 1.2 lakhs was debited from my account through multiple transactions. The caller's number
is now switched off. I did not authorise any of these transactions.

Evidence: Bank transaction records, call logs, screenshot of SMS.
